# Git: push targets

For this repo (**`ahackaday-site`**):

- **Default when the user says “push”:** push the **current branch** to `origin` (usually **`main`**). Do **not** automatically also push **`mono`** unless the user explicitly asks to update the preview branch.
- Use **`mono`** only when the user wants preview-branch deploys or says to push `mono` / update preview.

When releasing to production, they may still merge and push **`main`** as their normal flow.
